#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#   AI4REALNET D1.4 BlueSky scenario for testing the RL models on random 
#   Authors: Giulia Leto
#   Date: Nov 2025
#
#   Instructions: 
#   - in BlueSky, load 'PLUGIN deployRL_batch',
#   - load the scenario using 'DETACHED_BATCH ai4realnet_deploy_RL_MORL/ai4realnet_deploy_RL_MORL_single_scn.scn'
#     (a 'repeats' line is required: without it the plugin does not start the scenario)
#   - with the InteractiveAI bridge, run it in plugin mode (the default), not '--plugin None'
#
#   Available Environments: 
#   - StaticObstacleEnv-v0, 
#   - StaticObstacleCREnv-v0, 
#   - StaticObstacleSectorEnv-v0, 
#   - StaticObstacleSectorCREnv-v0
#
#   Available Algorithms: sac, ddpg, td3, ppo
#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

00:00:00.00>PLUGIN scenario_generator
00:00:00.00>PLUGIN disturbance_generator
# initialize_scenario <N_AC>, <N_OBSTACLES>
00:00:00.00> initialize_scenario 50, 5
00:00:00.00> perturbation weather on
00:00:00.00> perturbation volcanic on
# deploy_RL <ENVIRONMENT>, <ALGORITHM>
# 00:00:00.00> deploy_RL StaticObstacleEnv-v0 SAC
00:00:00.00> deploy_RL StaticObstacleCREnv-v1 SAC
# 00:00:00.00> deploy_RL StaticObstacleSectorEnv-v0 SAC
# 00:00:00.00> deploy_RL StaticObstacleSectorCREnv-v0 SAC
# pareto_front <DEMO|FOLDER>: checkpoints offered by the InteractiveAI Pareto front tab
# FOLDER = MORL run folder (dol_progress.json + iterations/iter_XXX/models/model.zip), looked up in
# ai4realnet_deploy_RL_models/<env>/ or given as an absolute path; DEMO = identical copies of the SAC model
00:00:00.00> pareto_front bluesky_sb3_SP
00:00:00.00>OP
# repeats <N_SCN>
00:00:00.00>repeats 1
